{
  "name": "Chatwoot AI support agent with human handoff",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Chatwoot AI support agent (original)\nChatwoot `message_created` webhook -> answer from a knowledge base -> reply in Chatwoot.\nLow confidence or sensitive topic -> holding reply, private note with the draft, `ai-handoff` label, conversation set to **open** so a human takes over.\n\nEdit **Config** first. Credential: one *Header Auth* named `api_access_token` (Chatwoot agent-bot or user token).\nRecipe: `workflows/recipes/chatwoot-n8n-ai-support.md`",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "1fde1777-4df0-5fa6-9a2b-0ce7e84405d5",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
